total-history market valuation matches the public journal API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight total-history --accounts 'Assets:Fund' --format json --valuation market

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ accounts: ['Assets:Fund'], valuation: 'market' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.00 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 150 SEK
2024-01-01 Buy
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {100 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -1000 SEK
